<Rung Number="44" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 13.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
<Rung Number="45" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 14.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
