<Rung Number="54" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 23.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
<Rung Number="55" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 24.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
<Rung Number="56" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 25.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
