<Rung Number="58" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 27.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
<Rung Number="59" Type="N"><Comment>Invented paging case 28.</Comment><Text>XIC(AlarmFlag)OTE(OutputB);</Text></Rung>
