<Rung Number="87" Type="N"><Comment>Invented malformed control use: bound unknown-role references remain unknown, with no execution or type claim.</Comment><Text>PID(AlarmFlag,Trigger,Reset,Enable,0,0,0);</Text></Rung>
</RLLContent></Routine></Routines></Program></Programs></Controller></RSLogix5000Content>
